WEBVTT

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:02.414
You create. We handle the business.

00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:05.600
First, know your angle.

00:00:05.650 --> 00:00:07.867
Your niche, your audience, your content.

00:00:08.200 --> 00:00:09.500
Then, find the fit.

00:00:09.550 --> 00:00:12.079
Brand opportunities that are relevant to you.

00:00:12.250 --> 00:00:14.300
Know the terms before you say yes.

00:00:14.350 --> 00:00:16.809
Deliverables, usage, exclusivity.

00:00:17.200 --> 00:00:18.800
We keep the details moving.

00:00:18.850 --> 00:00:21.165
Calendars, invoices, follow-ups.

00:00:21.450 --> 00:00:22.350
And you?

00:00:22.400 --> 00:00:23.759
You keep creating.

00:00:25.050 --> 00:00:28.218
Choose your level of support. It depends on your programme.

00:00:28.350 --> 00:00:29.750
Tell us what you're building.

00:00:29.800 --> 00:00:31.715
Explore creator management.
